First run (22:26) failed 20 checks, all from one cause: scripts were wrapped as
(function(){...}) and so had no completion value and made top-level
declarations local. Fixed by evaluating global scripts as they are and running
object scripts through a direct eval called with this = obj.

Raw library figures for comparison (PR #4): JS -> C empty native 51 us,
C -> JS on the script task 63 us. The header adds about 30-40 us per crossing
(glue wrapper, argument spread, arena). JS_Now ticks are coarse; treat these
as +/- 20 us.
